+# patchtree
+
+Renders **raw diffs** with `tree-sitter` and a [file tree](https://example.com).
+
+## Install
+
+```sh
+make && npx playwright install chromium
+```
+
+```go
+func main() {
+	const greeting = "hello"
+	fmt.Println(greeting)
+}
+```
+
+```yaml
+spec:
+  replicas: 4
+```
+
+> A quote with *emphasis*.
